==Trivia==
*The producers originally planned season five to be the last season of ''[[Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.]]''. However, [[American Broadcasting Company (network)|ABC]] requested more episodes and renewed the show for a [[Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D./Season Six|sixth season]].<ref>[https://comicbook.com/marvel/2019/07/24/agents-of-shield-producers-wrote-season-5-as-series-finale/ Agents of SHIELD Producers Wrote Season 5 as Series Finale]</ref>
*This the second season where a series regular actor is credited as a guest or recurring star.
**[[Brett Dalton]] was credited as recurring in Season 4 as [[Grant Ward/Framework]], and [[Nick Blood]] is credited as guest for [[Lance Hunter]] in this season.
*This is the only season to feature a two-hour premiere.
*This is the last season to feature its normal 22 episode length.
*This is the first season to feature [[Natalia Cordova-Buckley]] ([[Yo-Yo Rodriguez|Elena "Yo-Yo" Rodriguez]]) as a series regular. She was promoted from recurring cast in the previous two seasons.
*As this was intended to be the final season of the series, [[Phil Coulson]] and [[Leo Fitz/Destroyed Earth|Leo Fitz]] were both written out of the series in the season finale however their actors, [[Clark Gregg]] and [[Iain De Caestecker]] would return as series regulars in the next season.
*This is the last season to feature [[Phil Coulson]] as the protagonist.

